== strategist metrics handoff-record
use: handoff-record
short: Record the Archivist's handoff metrics line for a mission
long: |
  Append the Archivist's per-refinement line to .strategist/memory/handoff-metrics.jsonl. Only the values passed are recorded; every other field is null, and the two ratios are never derived because the contracts do not define them. A mission that already has a line is left unchanged.
flag: --brief-compression-ratio (float64) default="0" usage="brief compression ratio, as measured by the caller (omit when not measured)"
flag: --brief-tokens (int64) default="0" usage="tokens in the discovery brief (omit when not measured)"
flag: --discovery-tokens (int64) default="0" usage="tokens spent by discovery (omit when not measured)"
flag: --effort (string) default="" usage="Archivist effort (omit when unknown)"
flag: --evidence-coverage-ratio (float64) default="0" usage="evidence coverage ratio, as measured by the caller (omit when not measured)"
flag: --level-source (string) default="" usage="how the level was resolved, for example host (omit when unknown)"
flag: --mission (string) default="" usage="mission id (required)"
flag: --model (string) default="" usage="Archivist model (omit when unknown)"
flag: --reopens (int) default="0" usage="sources the Archivist reopened, each with a declared reason"
flag: --root (string) default="" usage="path to .strategist/ root (default: auto-discovered from CWD)"

